  ('zcrm_5797994000003292238', 'Datapeople', 'Datapeople', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Amit Bhatia', 'Developer of AI-powered recruiting productivity software intended to support hiring teams globally. The company integrates natural language processing, behavioral science and data analytics to help standardize job descriptions and improve hiring outcomes, thereby enabling inclusive and compliant recruitment practices at scale.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 09:39:38', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292273', 'Lingawa', 'Lingawa', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Frank Williams', 'Developer of an online tutoring platform intended to offer fun, engaging online lessons in native languages. The company''s platform includes a wide range of courses to learn from and also connects students to experienced tutors who share creativity and critical thinking through progressive teaching methods and by leveraging technology, enabling students, adults and kids aged five and up to receive assistance with their studies.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 09:45:45', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292308', 'SchoolAI', 'SchoolAI', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Caleb Hicks', 'SchoolAI is a classroom with AI-powered tools that helps schools embrace AI tech for students, teachers, and school leaders. The company aims to magnify the humanity in every school, creating tighter relationships between teachers, students, school leaders, and the local community and help schools with professional development to adopt AI tosupercharge teachers in their classrooms, empower students for an AI-driven world, and give everyone in the building a more personal experience', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 09:55:18', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292344', 'Esteam', 'Esteam', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Nicholas Clay', 'Developer of a virtual reading tutor platform designed to help children become independent readers. The company''s platform offers AI-powered personalized stories, speech recognition features, and automated assessments, enabling teachers, parents, and students to close the literacy gap and foster an interest in reading.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 10:00:05', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292379', '1Huddle', '1Huddle', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Sam Caucci', 'Developer of a game-based workforce training platform designed to onboard, upskill, and develop employees. The company''s platform converts boring training material into competitive games that are proven to improve employee engagement and performance, enabling businesses to carry out sales and service training and education programs for their employees in a fun and interactive way.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 10:16:45', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292414', 'AboveBoard', 'AboveBoard', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Murali Murugan', 'Developer of an inclusive recruitment platform designed for executive hiring, free from any discrimination. The company''s platform offers to recruit and hire executives and board members by offering cost-effective alternatives to traditional retained executive search that also expand opportunities for female, Black, Latin, and executives from other underrepresented groups, enabling people to get hired with the same opportunity as their preferences.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 10:21:08', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292449', 'Awesome People Leaders', 'Awesome People Leaders', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Heather Polivka', 'Developer of a corporate training platform designed for organizations to help managers learn how to treat people. The company''s platform provides a mobile manager training experience featuring micro-lessons, practical applications, resources, tools, and support from experienced business team leaders, enabling leaders to cultivate a way of working that fuels their business and empowers their people.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 10:30:02', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292484', 'MoveUp', 'MoveUp', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Emil Palikot', 'Developer of a career planning platform designed to analyze skills and experience to suggest career paths for individuals and help organizations find the right talent. The company''s platform analyzes a person''s skills and experience to suggest potential career paths, along with helping organizations identify skill gaps in their workforce and develop strategies to address them, enabling customers to make informed career decisions and organizations to build right-performing teams.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 10:33:28', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292519', 'Workbrew', 'Workbrew', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'John Britton', 'Developer of work management platform designed to help developers deploy, secure, and manage their systems. The company''s platform provides faster onboarding, quickly mitigated security vulnerabilities, and consistent usage across teams and projects, enabling development teams to assist in outsourcing the partner companies'' work according to the needs of their clients and to level up their work.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 10:57:20', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292554', 'LINGO', 'LINGO', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Aisha Bowe', 'Operator of an educational platform intended to offer products to build confidence and problem-solving skills through hands-on projects. The company''s platform helps build engineering projects, learn to code, innovate, and explore STEM modules, enabling students to discover and experience fun and hands-on projects that ignite curiosity and learning.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 11:13:37', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292589', 'Lafayette Square', 'Lafayette Square', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Rhiannon Davies', 'Operator of a private credit investment platform intended to expand access to capital for underserved working-class communities through responsible underwriting and operational support. The company offers non-sponsored deal structures, managerial assistance via an affiliated workforce platform, a technology-driven investment strategy, and institutional partnerships, enabling impact-focused investors to support overlooked regions while pursuing stable, risk-adjusted returns.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 11:20:27', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292624', 'MakeMyMove', 'MakeMyMove', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'William Oesterie', 'Operator of a marketing platform intended to assist remote workers in relocating to new communities with incentives and networking opportunities. The company''s platform utilizes a talent database to profile data on each candidate and offers a seamless process for discovering relocation offers, applying for incentives and receiving personalized support, enabling remote workers to relocate to new places with financial perks and a welcoming local community.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 11:32:28', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292660', 'Educato', 'Educato', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Cordut Lemeni', 'Operator of an AI-based exam prep platform intended to serve underserved students. The company''s platform allows the creation of exam prep sites, personalized learning paths, essay grading with feedback, live tests, score analysis, custom domain, and other services, enabling educators to focus more on teaching.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 12:17:52', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292695', 'Inner Fit', 'Inner Fit', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Sanchit Garg', 'Operator of a professional coaching platform intended to derive behavior change for leadership skills. The company''s platform provides online coaching to help businesses implement new behavioral aspects to broaden their vision and promote a healthy working environment, enabling clients to invest in their employees'' leadership development with the assistance of experts.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 12:22:22', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292730', 'WorkTorch', 'WorkTorch', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Angela Muhwezi-Hall', 'WorkTorch is a career discovery platform for the service economy workforce. We partner with job seekers to find career fulfillment by finding the right job and advancement opportunities. This unique approach helps us provide a better engaged and aligned talent pool for employers. Developer of a hiring and career discovery platform designed to find work and talent for skilled trade and service industry workers. The company operates online marketplaces for blue-collar jobs to match employers and suitable job seekers, enabling companies to remove barriers related to hiring employees and helping job seekers advance career development.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 12:37:40', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003292766', 'Anthill', 'Anthill', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Muriel Closs', 'Developer of a talent management software designed to support workforce development and retention. The company''s platform leverages artificial intelligence to automate workflows, provide real-time translation, facilitate engagement, enable internal mobility, support reskilling, and offer career development tools while allowing employees to share insights and access assistance, enabling employers to manage staffing needs and personalize growth opportunities.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 12:55:52', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
