  ('zcrm_5797994000003294854', 'Place Genomics', 'Place Genomics', 'Brandon McClean', 'Place Genomics Info', 'Developer of genomic analysis technology designed to provide detailed genetic inside for health research and personalised medicine. the company offers a range of laboutry and computation services including proximity ligation sequencing genomic mapping and advanced bioinformatics providing research , healthcare provider and biotech firms with precise callable and tools that facilitate the understanding of complex structures and support the development of targeted therapeutics and diagnostics.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Brandon McClean', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-14 17:50:24', '2026-02-12 11:58:39', '2026-02-12 11:58:39'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003294875', 'Sora Fuel', 'Sora Fuel', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Gareth Ross', 'Manufacturer of climate technology products intended for affordable, carbon-negative drop-in systems. The company produces e-fuels from carbon directly captured from the air, in a closed-loop system reliant only on water and electricity, enabling clients to capture, utilize, and fuel synthesis processes that dramatically reduce overall energy inputs, and eliminate the need for feedstocks.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 02:53:10', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
