  ('zcrm_5797994000003295054', 'summer robotics', 'Summer Robotics', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Schuyler Cullen Ph.D', 'Developer of breakthrough (three-dimensional) 3D robotic visual intelligence software that enables high-speed, precision automation. The company''s Kortx platform combines microsecond-precise event sensors with continuous laser scanning to deliver blur-free 3D tracking with sub-5ms latency - 10x faster than traditional camera-based systems and this is patented technology, allowing robots to see and interact with fast-moving objects in real-time or even on reflective surfaces with advanced manufacturing tasks previously impossible to automate.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-14 19:11:00', '2025-10-29 05:53:24', '2025-10-29 05:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003295080', 'arch systems', 'arch systems', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Timothy Burke Ph.D', 'Developer of a data analytics platform designed to gather real-time and predictive analytics for manufacturing and industrial applications. The company''s platform connects to all machines, new and legacy, across enterprise supply chains, driving unparalleled insights, monitoring and data accessibility specifically in the electronics and discrete industries, enabling clients to drive efficient business decisions.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-14 19:15:58', '2025-10-29 05:53:24', '2025-10-29 05:53:24'),
