  ('zcrm_5797994000003311107', 'First Light Solutions', 'First Light Solutions', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Matt Rivera Ph.D', 'Developer of an AI-powered materials discovery platform designed to create advanced adsorbents for efficient industrial gas separations. The company''s technology combines proprietary machine learning models with automated laboratory validation to design and optimize adsorbents tailored to specific operating environments, enabling energy and manufacturing industries to reduce emissions, lower costs, and accelerate the transition to cleaner, more efficient processes.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Quick Screen', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-22 20:28:43', '2025-11-04 10:48:32', '2025-11-04 10:48:32'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003311155', 'infinitForm', 'InfinitForm', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Michael Bogomolny Ph.D', 'Developer of an engineering software company intended to accelerate and optimize the engineering design process for manufacturing. The company specializes in transformative software that streamlines the design-to-manufacturing process, integrating seamlessly with various manufacturing methods to optimize cost, speed, efficiency and performance, enabling clients to access Gen-AI design software that accelerates innovation, enhancing performance and manufacturability with speed.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-23 06:38:16', '2025-10-29 05:53:24', '2025-10-29 05:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003311181', 'Righthand Robotics', 'Righthand Robotics', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Yaroslav Tenzer Ph.D', 'Manufacturer of robotic piece-picking systems designed to help clients manage supply chain logistics. The company''s systems are simple to integrate and adapt to improve the utilization of various customer workflows such as sorting batch-picked items, inducting items to a belt sorter, and order quality assurance, enabling clients to reduce the cost of order fulfillment in electronics, apparel, grocery, pharmaceuticals, and other industries.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-23 06:41:58', '2025-10-29 05:53:24', '2025-10-29 05:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003311208', 'Scope (Sugar Land)', 'Scope (Sugar Land)', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Justin Mccoy', 'Developer of an automated product inspection software intended to improve safety and compliance in industries that utilize synthetic rope. The company leverages artificial intelligence and machine learning products that assess the performance of synthetic rope for manufacturers and operators of utility stringing equipment and users in the maritime industry, enabling rope manufacturers and operators to detect and grade damage modes on stringing lines.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-23 06:49:39', '2025-10-25 13:44:10', '2025-10-25 13:44:10'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003311234', 'Revvo', 'Revvo', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Sunjay Dodani Ph.D', 'Developer of vehicle tires management platform designed to connect, monitor, and manage vehicle tires automatically. The company''s platform uses sensors and artificial intelligence that can be embedded inside the tire and generates a real-time feed of a tire''s condition and performance by capturing data points from the interior of the tire which is sent to the cloud via an application on the driver''s phone, enabling fleet operators to predict tire health and improve performance and provide tire manufacturers, retailers, and distributors with insights that help in complete user-centric data for product development and improvements.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-23 06:52:04', '2025-10-25 13:44:10', '2025-10-25 13:44:10'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003311261', 'GreyscaleAI', 'GreyscaleAI', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Paul Kirincich', 'Developer of high-performance inspection systems designed to inspect the seals of pouches, bags, and rigid containers. The company''s platform leverages high-resolution X-ray imaging and advanced artificial intelligence algorithms to give unmatched product inspection accuracy with the power of cloud-based data analytics, enabling manufacturers in the food industry to detect sealing defects and ensure a tightly controlled sealing process.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-23 09:50:02', '2025-10-25 13:44:10', '2025-10-25 13:44:10'),
