  ('zcrm_5797994000003314040', 'MoBack', 'MoBack', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Devkumar Gandhi', 'Developer of a digital business and augmented reality platform designed to provide cutting-edge VR simulations and tools for autonomous vehicles and robotics. The company''s platform offers innovative VR simulations and tools specifically designed for autonomous vehicles and robotics, enabling customers to optimize performance, streamline development processes and accelerate the future of autonomous technology.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-21 15:29:20', '2025-10-21 15:29:20', NULL),
