  ('zcrm_5797994000003314734', 'Rogo Ag', 'Rogo Ag', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Troy Fiechter', 'Developer of a soil sampling robot designed to get consistent soil samples to apply fertilizer efficiently. The company''s robot provides a full-service robotic soil sampling program from grid sampling through lab analysis and fertilizer recommendations through autonomous navigation, precise depth control, and error-proof data handling, enabling farmers and agricultural retailers to build accurate fertility management plans, obtain reliable soil data that supports optimized fertilizer application and improved crop yields.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-26 17:30:07', '2025-10-26 17:30:07', NULL),
