  ('zcrm_5797994000003358043', 'BuildQ', 'BuildQ', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Maryssa', 'uildQ is an AI-powered platform that keeps every clean energy project financing-ready from day one.
Upload a permit, model, or contract and—within seconds—BuildQ folds it into a single, bankable record: version-tracked, audit-ready, and scored against lender-approved due diligence checklists.
Because BuildQ layers onto the tools your team already uses, it works in the background while you develop: missing data is flagged the moment it appears; project trackers update in real time; your optimal path to close is always clear. No more digging through project folders. No spreadsheet chaos.
Designed by developers, lawyers, and financiers, BuildQ mirrors the way projects actually get built—from first site control to financial close—so whether you''re developing a project or investing in one, BuildQ has built a solution to help you scale with confidence.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-11-09 09:47:11', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003358078', 'Loula', 'Loula', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Gustavo', 'Loula is a software platform and national provider network dedicated to independent birth and postpartum doulas who accept Medicaid/Medi-Cal. The company aims to empower doulas by simplifying insurance and administrative processes, allowing them to concentrate on delivering quality care to their clients.
Loula offers services that assist doulas in getting credentialed and contracted with various managed care plans through a single streamlined form. The platform manages insurance administration and compliance, including adherence to HIPAA standards, enabling doulas to operate as independent 1099 contractors. Currently, Loula serves California and is expanding to other states that provide Medicaid coverage for doula services.
The platform is designed for doulas seeking to accept Medicaid/Medi-Cal clients and needing support with the credentialing and contracting processes. Loula provides a compliant and efficient way for these professionals to access insurance reimbursements and grow their practices. Show Less', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-11-09 09:52:41', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
