  ('zcrm_5797994000003358233', 'Northwind Climate', 'Northwind Climate', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Doug', 'Developer of a data-driven SaaS platform designed to deliver business intelligence to companies to help maximize the return on their climate tech investments. The company''s platform streamlines the market research process and delivers public opinion research, public opinion data and predictive models in a cost-effective and scalable way that help companies to understand the market landscape, attract new customers, reduce customer acquisition costs and build authenticity and trust, enabling businesses to market their climate actions and products, increase revenue and strengthen their brand.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-11 18:45:25', '2025-12-02 10:47:30', '2025-12-02 10:47:30'),
