  ('zcrm_5797994000003406054', 'Atlas5D', 'Atlas5D', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Timothy Chevalier Ph.D', 'Developer of an investigational device designed to measure brain, neuromuscular, and cardiovascular conditions in patients. The company''s device does not require any special objects to be worn and needed to be placed on a shelf and it measures speed, strength, balance, dexterity, and use of objects, enabling doctors to learn patients'' everyday behavior.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-18 15:27:20', '2026-01-27 16:30:27', '2026-01-27 16:30:27'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003406080', 'Aarca', 'Aarca Research', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Gayathri Choda', 'Developer of screening devices intended to assess health risks without requiring invasive procedures. The company''s devices utilize thermal cameras and computer vision and are integrated with artificial intelligence for early detection and risk assessment of diabetes and hypertension, enabling clinicians to perform the required treatment and improve patient outcomes.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PB', 'Have not Reached out', 'MF', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-18 15:29:33', '2026-01-27 16:30:32', '2026-01-27 16:30:32'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003406106', 'EqualityMD', 'EqualityMD', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Justin Ayars', 'Developer of a LGBTQ+ (lesbian, gay, bisexual, and transgender) inclusive telehealth, prescription fulfillment, and data insights platform designed to connect patients with culturally competent providers nationwide accounting for each patient''s unique needs and intersectional identities. The company offers mental health, primary care, and urgent care providers who''ve completed LGBTQ+ cultural competency training, uses an artificial intelligence (AI) informed matching algorithm that connects patients with providers based on each patient''s unique needs & intersectional identities, enabling users with a digital safe space where they have telehealth sessions, manage medications & connect with other patients and also provide new actionable data insights for health systems, payors and employers that will advance health equity for underserved communities nationwide.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-18 15:35:37', '2026-01-27 16:29:45', '2026-01-27 16:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003406132', 'BioLum Sciences', 'BioLum Sciences', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Jack Reynolds', 'Developer of a chemiluminescent platform designed for biomarker detection. The company''s platform uses chemical systems to measure biomarker detection in cells, exhaled breath condensate, blood, and buffer to manage and treat chronic inflammatory diseases such as asthma, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), hypertension, and heart failure, providing physicians, researchers, enabling patients with a critical gauge of endothelial function and cardiovascular health to have assistance.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-18 15:39:23', '2025-11-18 15:39:23', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003406158', 'GelMEDIX', 'GelMEDIX', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Max Cotler', 'Developer of a light-activated biomaterial platform designed to bring innovation in ocular and regenerative therapies. The company''s platform focuses on bio-adhesion, tissue regeneration, tunable mechanics, and therapeutic loading across modalities from small molecules to cell and gene therapies through its photo-crosslinked hydrogels, enabling medical professionals to perform cell-based therapies for vision restoration, intraocular sustained release of small molecules and peptides, and in situ forming bioadhesives.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-18 15:42:46', '2026-01-27 17:13:32', '2026-01-27 17:13:32'),
