  ('zcrm_5797994000003478123', 'Leuko', 'Leuko', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Carlos Gonzalez', 'Developer of a home-based neutrophil test device designed to monitor and count white blood cells. The company''s device is non-invasive sees through the skin also counts white blood cells and monitors patients'' neutrophil levels ranging from chemotherapy management to the detection of life-threatening infections, enabling physicians to offer personalized chemotherapy and improve the survival rate of patients.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 11:10:12', '2026-01-28 11:46:17', '2026-01-28 11:46:17'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478149', 'Accure Health', 'Accure Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Jessica Sang', 'Operator of a precision medicine company intended to offer artificial intelligence-powered, biomarker-guided care tailored to individual patients. The company offers proprietary protein design pipelines and a patented biomarker device, enabling patients to access targeted therapies delivered precisely to the right cells.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 11:15:16', '2026-01-28 11:46:07', '2026-01-28 11:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478175', 'VeraMorph', 'VeraMorph', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Douglas Godfrin', 'Developer of an oral drug delivery technology designed to provide contract manufacturing and formulation services using proprietary oral hydrogel tablets. The company''s technology creates an optimal combination of high drug stability, fast dissolution rate, and prolonged levels of high saturation in an oral dosage form capable of higher drug loading than current formulations, enabling pharmaceutical companies to improve the performance of their products, reduce the cost and time to bring them to market.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 11:41:13', '2026-01-28 11:45:57', '2026-01-28 11:45:57'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478201', 'Visor.Health', 'Visor.Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Kevin Rapp', 'Operator of an AI-driven clinical platform for musculoskeletal injury care. The company leverages AI to deliver diagnostic, care management, and value-based care solutions for musculoskeletal injuries, and they seamlessly engage throughout their healing journey in collaboration with their local care providers to help ensure optimal healing in an optimal time, enabling patients to have access to proper diagnostic care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 11:47:47', '2025-12-06 11:47:47', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478227', 'ArcheHealth', 'ArcheHealth', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Ralph Keiser', 'Developer of an AI-based healthcare data platform intended to empower hospitals to work smarter, reduce costs and sustain growth. The company''s platform analyzes de-identified clinical, financial and operational data from multiple sources to highlight process inefficiencies and reduce costs, such as in labor, supplies and drugs, creating sustainable margin growth, enabling hospitals to enhance patient processes and shift from reactive to proactive performance management.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 11:53:17', '2025-12-06 11:53:17', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478253', 'Persperion Diagnostics', 'Persperion Diagnostics', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Xinyu Liu', 'Operator of a medical device company intended to develop a novel non-invasive sweat biomarker sensing technology. The company aims to reimagine personalized health management using natural fingertip sweat and develops a touch-based enzymatic electrochemical sensing strip, enabling patients to sense different biomarkers within natural fingertip perspiration.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 12:00:37', '2026-01-28 11:45:33', '2026-01-28 11:45:33'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478287', 'ThetaRho', 'ThetaRho', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Kannan Govindarajan', 'Developer of a software-as-a-service-based application designed to transform administrative processes in healthcare. The platform offers a natural language interface for retrieving contextual data during visits, automates administrative tasks such as prescription orders and referrals, and generates visit summaries and inbox responses, while also providing timely access to health information and automated scheduling tools, enabling healthcare providers to reduce administrative burden and focus more on patient care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 13:33:28', '2026-01-28 11:45:15', '2026-01-28 11:45:15'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003478318', 'Decode Health', 'Decode Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Chase Spurlock', 'Operator of a medicine analytics company intended to deliver accurate, predictive insights to fuel proactive management of disease risk and health outcomes. The company platform leverages deep know-how and support across multi-omics, clinical data, social determinants of health, and other healthcare data sources to de-risk R&D and deliver actionable insights and results quickly, it provides accurate and scalable data to leverage genomics, clinical data, and other healthcare sources to provide quick insights and include biomarker discovery, RNA diagnostics, and population health analytics to improve patient outcomes and reduce costs and helps partners to establish repeatable innovation programs with a focus on chronic diseases such as multiple sclerosis, IBD, diabetes, COPD, CKD, and cancer, thereby improving health equity by giving healthcare companies access to technology to decode unrecognized patterns of disease risk and tackle complex health care problems.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-06 13:52:01', '2026-01-28 11:54:25', '2026-01-28 11:54:25'),
